        "median latency, achieved TFLOP/s, and throughput ratio",
        "中位延迟、实际 TFLOP/s 与吞吐比",
        "Both candidates call `torch.mm`, so the installed PyTorch/cuBLAS stack selects tactics. The code synchronizes with events and validates output shapes; it does not label internal instructions without a trace.",
        "两个候选都调用 `torch.mm`，由已安装的 PyTorch/cuBLAS 选择 tactic。代码用 Event 同步并校验输出 shape，不会在没有 trace 时给内部指令贴标签。",
        "Treat alignment as a measured performance variable and preserve the full shape/dtype/backend identity with every result.",
        "把对齐看作需要测量的性能变量，并随结果保留完整 shape、dtype 与 backend 身份。",
        "Library autotuning, clocks, workspace, and architecture can select different kernels. Awkward does not always mean slower, especially when the total work is smaller.",
